","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"たしか東北きりたんの歌声データベースが研究目的に提供できたのもこの改正のおかげって聞いた","ts":"1628738966.261900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2U9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fad367e2-40ea-46fa-b175-d59615e32c4a","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"\u003chttps://storialaw.jp/blog/4936\u003e\n難しい話はむつかしい","ts":"1628738861.260500","attachments":[{"fallback":"STORIA法律事務所: 進化する機械学習パラダイス ～改正著作権法が日本のAI開発をさらに加速する～ | STORIA法律事務所","id":1,"title":"進化する機械学習パラダイス ～改正著作権法が日本のAI開発をさらに加速する～ | STORIA法律事務所","title_link":"https://storialaw.jp/blog/4936","text":"■　はじめに 学習済みモデル生成のためには大量の生データや生データを元に生成した学習用データセットが必要となりますが、その際に著作物である生データ（文章、写真、静止画、動画など）を利用することも多くあります。 著作権法上、著作物は著作権者に無断で利用（ダウンロードや改変等）することは出来ませんが、実は日本の今の著作権法には４７条の７という世界的に見ても希な条文があるため（詳細は後述）、ＡＩ開発目的","image_url":"https://storialaw.jp/wp-new/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/pixta_35387108_S.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1535850281,"service_name":"STORIA法律事務所","service_icon":"https://storialaw.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://storialaw.jp/blog/4936","original_url":"https://storialaw.jp/blog/4936"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nqpoo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"204c3d1c-4c1c-4de0-b2ba-377ae0ea48f8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"学習させるの自体には適用されないけど、使ったらアウトだよね多分","ts":"1628738727.260100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0axuJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79c9b502-263e-455f-a84f-efaf3328dd40","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"日本では人が直接読まない、機械学習のためにデータベースを構築する際には著作権は適用されないとかだったかしら","ts":"1628738681.259400","edited":{"user":"U7HFY4HFY","ts":"1628738731.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASgJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b8ba9ab-2f22-40f5-b780-3dc718dfb20f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"deopleteの時には必要に思っていた機能もいらないなぁ","ts":"1628730672.257300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AoL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0354210a-3c4a-458f-8710-92b9e0d6b4b6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimはあらゆるオプションをファイルタイプ固有に定義できるから、deopleteの時よりも柔軟性が増している","ts":"1628730370.256300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"exR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f27b08a-1dad-4909-9cef-5bd2a0589152","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"補完されたコードのライセンスがどうなるのか問題がはっきりするまではあまり使いたいとは思えない…","ts":"1628730163.255300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w1eu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64EB7B8C-BE70-454C-9AAC-E16A046147FD","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cocで使いたい\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/natfriedman/status/1425055765224595458?s=21|https://twitter.com/natfriedman/status/1425055765224595458?s=21\u003e","ts":"1628729916.254600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/natfriedman|@natfriedman\u003e: We've started work to add GitHub Copilot support for vim and JetBrains. Quick preview of Copilot in IntelliJ: \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E8bQo2CVUAM3jMR.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Nat Friedman","author_subname":"@natfriedman","author_link":"https://twitter.com/natfriedman/status/1425055765224595458","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1677873294/image_normal.jpg","text":"We've started work to add GitHub Copilot support for vim and JetBrains. Quick preview of Copilot in IntelliJ:","thumb_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/E8bQo2CVUAM3jMR.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628594745,"service_name":"twitter","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":750,"video